Package: DataAssessment
Type: Package
Title: OHDSI Data Assessment of a Prostate Cancer Treatment Cohort Cascade
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Andrei", "Kiselev", email = "kiselev.eco@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Assesses patient counts in an OMOP CDM database by building a
    cascade of simple and intersected cohorts (prostate cancer, metastasis,
    androgen deprivation therapy and subsequent treatments), reporting
    intersections, binned index-date differences, Kaplan-Meier event
    probabilities for hypertension, hospitalization and death, and a light
    CohortDiagnostics run. Designed for federated network use with small cell
    count censoring.
License: Apache License 2.0
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
